2025-12-24 15:48:42 | INFO | Q675 id=BV1BPRnYAEx6_00-14-34_00-14-40 | baseline_pred=C | gold=C | prompt_variant= | followup_pred=C | followup_correct=True | raw=Reason step by step:\n1.  **Analyze the audio information:** The audio states that one steak (牛排) costs "more than 50 US dollars" (要50多美元), which is approximately "400 RMB" (大概400人民币). It then states that if everyone has one steak (如果一人一份牛排), the total cost will be "1600 RMB" (就要花掉1600).\n2.  **Determine the relationship:** The total cost is the price per person multiplied by the number of people.\n    $$\text{Total Cost} = \text{Price per person} \times \text{Number of people}$$\n3.  **Calculate the number of people:**\n    $$\text{Number of people} = \frac{\text{Total Cost}}{\text{Price per person}}$$\n    $$\text{Number of people} = \frac{1600 \text{ RMB}}{400 \text{ RMB/person}}$$\n    $$\text{Number of people} = 4$$\n4.  **Compare with choices:** The calculated number of people is 4, which corresponds to choice C.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{C}$
