ly the craftsmanship.\n*   D) Ugly: This contradicts her direct statement.\n\nBased *only* on the direct statement made about the bracelet ("I love your bracelet"), the attitude expressed is positive, aligning best with finding it beautiful.\n\n**Conclusion:** The speaker explicitly stated she loved the bracelet.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
