uditory evidence, the last sound (Attempt 4) is the most resonant, indicating the longest extended length. Therefore, the last time corresponds to the longest extension.\n\nThe last time is the fourth attempt.\n\nComparing this to the options:\nA) first time\nB) second to last time (Third time)\nC) last time (Fourth time)\nD) second time\n\nThe longest extension corresponds to the last time (Attempt 4).\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{C}$
