tions, which are known for their complex signature whistles and burst-pulsed sounds used in close-range communication.\n\nBased on the acoustic evidence (whistles and clicks characteristic of odontocetes), Bottlenose Dolphin (A) is the most likely source among the given options.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
